(text "EXT port logic (TUSB320LAI, GPIO mode, DRP):\n charger attached  -> CC sees Rp -> UFP -> ID high-Z -> A_EN = VBUS divider -> A on (charges console)\n device attached   -> CC sees Rd -> DFP -> ID low   -> B_EN high -> B on (console OTG powers device); A forced off via D3\n dead console      -> U2 unpowered presents Rd -> charger gives VBUS -> A on, VDOCK via D2\nNever connect OTG_VBUS to CHG_VBUS. 5 V only (no PD)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 150 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9518e074-78c2-566f-b0cc-5b15219708ff")) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
